WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,830
He's eating chicken up there

2
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:17,480
We can only eat wild vegetables here. Zhou Tingchao stick, come up with me, Sister Weiwei.

3
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,080
He is a man after all

4
