8
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:35,340
Watching us starve

9
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,340
Still a man?

10
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:37,940
am i a man

11
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,140
If you don’t want to try, you would like to know Zhou Ting

12
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:52,890
